From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chromium meta-browser maintainers <meta-browser@lists.openembedded.org>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 13:30:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] devtools: Declare generated CSS tsconfig output

generate_css_js_files.js writes a <target>-tsconfig.json in addition to the
generated JavaScript files, but generate_css.gni did not declare that file as
a Ninja output. This leaves the TypeScript dependency missing after an
incremental or resumed build.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [OE-specific]
---
 .../src/scripts/build/ninja/generate_css.gni | 7 +++++--
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/third_party/devtools-frontend/src/scripts/build/ninja/generate_css.gni b/third_party/devtools-frontend/src/scripts/build/ninja/generate_css.gni
--- a/third_party/devtools-frontend/src/scripts/build/ninja/generate_css.gni
+++ b/third_party/devtools-frontend/src/scripts/build/ninja/generate_css.gni
@@ -32,1 +32,2 @@
-    outputs = []
+    outputs = [ "$target_gen_dir/$target_name-tsconfig.json" ]
+    _grd_outputs = []
@@ -34,0 +35,1 @@
+      _grd_outputs += [ "$target_gen_dir/$_input.js" ]
@@ -41,1 +43,1 @@
-        grd_files = outputs
+        grd_files = _grd_outputs
-- 
2.54.0
